-- Story load: Girasoles (slug: girasoles) — draft state, pending Patrick's OK to publish
-- Pattern: noche-estrellada recovery load (idempotent, accent-safe, docker cp + psql -f).
-- Deletes are scoped: does NOT touch noche-estrellada connections (Lust for Life is
-- artist-level for the same artist — an artist_id-wide delete would destroy it).
